/* Windows-only strings — English.

   Same format as the macOS Localizable.strings: the key is the English text, %@ stands where the
   C# call site has {0}, {1}, … (in that order), and %% is a literal percent sign. A key that also
   exists in a macOS catalogue overrides the Mac wording for every language that lists it here.
   Generate the .resx files with: dotnet run --project windows/tools/StringsToResx */

